<title>UK: Norddeutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.75	MATURITY    18.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-24.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 18.APR.97 THEN 4.25 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	     CALLABLE AT PAR 18.APR.97</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
